<title>USA: Pelican Rapids, Minn., won by Miller &amp; Schroeder.</title>
<headline>Pelican Rapids, Minn., won by Miller &amp; Schroeder.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miller &amp; Schroeder Financial, Inc., said it won $1.450 million of Pelican Rapids, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.2105 percent.</p>
</text>
